            <ArticleTitle>[Managing unspoken pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pathologies such as autism or deficit psychosis present an &quot;absence of language&quot;. This makes it difficult for distress to be spotted. Any pain, either physical or psychological, is manifested through the body. The nursingteam is a major resource especially when it is supported by reflection and specific nursing tools.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
